      "text": [
        "Why One-to-One",
        "The whole studio, booked for you.",
        "No other chairs, no other clients, no one else's schedule bleeding into yours. This is what changes when a studio only ever runs one appointment at a time.",
        "Full attention, every visit",
        "Your barber isn't managing three heads at once. From the first snip to the final check in the mirror, it's just you and the work.",
        "Consistency you can rely on",
        "Same barber, same notes on your fade, your parting, your quirks — every single time. No re-explaining what you want.",
        "A calmer 45 minutes",
        "No clippers buzzing three chairs over, no radio competing with conversation. Just a quiet room, good light, and proper focus."
      ]
    },
