        "Straightforward cuts, properly done.",
        "Every service is booked as a private slot — arrive, sit, and the hour is yours. Prices include a consultation and a finish with product.",
        "Signature Cut",
        "Consultation, wash, precision cut, styling finish.",
        "Skin Fade",
        "Zero-blade fade blended into a styled top, sharp neckline.",
        "Cut & Beard",
        "Full haircut paired with a shaped, lined beard trim.",
        "Beard Sculpt",
        "Shape, line-up, and conditioning oil finish.",
        "Hot Towel Shave",
        "Traditional straight-razor shave with a hot towel prep and finish.",
        "Grey Blending",
        "Cut plus a natural, low-maintenance grey blend treatment.",
        "Standing monthly slots are available for regulars — ask about a recurring booking when you visit."
